caption: Mission Progression

All Starbucks Jobs are ranked from G to Triple-S, just like our Field Operators (the informal way to refer to Starbucks Field Operation Specialists, because SFOS doesn’t roll off the tongue). This isn’t a coincidence! To start with, you can only take G rank Jobs, because that’s where everyone starts! But as soon as you clear five missions at a given Job Rank, you can start taking on missions of the next rank, up to one higher than your current actual rank! In fact, this is how you rank up! Once you have completed five missions at a higher rank than your current Field Operations Rank, you can test to rank up, giving you access to better, more profitable missions!
